{"work": "Texas Flip N Move", "page": "Texas Flip N Move", "passage": "Texas Flip N Move\nTexas Flip N Move - Wikipedia Texas Flip N Move Jump to : navigation , search Texas Flip N Move Genre Reality television Country of origin United States Original language ( s ) English Production Running time 40 minutes Release Original network DIY Network Original release November 11 , 2014 ( 2014 - 11 - 11 ) -- present External links Website texasflipnmove. build Texas Flip N Move is a show featured on DIY Network . Contents ( hide ) 1 Premise 1.1 Cast 2 Series overview 3 See also 4 References 5 External links Premise ( edit ) The show features professional home renovators who purchase older houses to flip for profit . However , unlike Property Brothers or other similar shows , the show features a twist : at the auction , only the houses are sold ( not the underlying land ) . The bidders can only view the home from the outside and must also factor in costs of moving the house from the original lot to the renovation site ( another facility where the houses are renovated and later sold at auction to purchasers wanting houses to move to existing property ) .", "connected": "DIY Network"}
