Before the duel is finished , they are separated by a seismic fissure created by the collapsing base . Rey and the others escape as Snoke orders General Hux to evacuate the base and bring Ren to him to complete his training . The last Jedi ( 2017 ) ( edit ) Main article : Star Wars : The Last Jedi Ren 's inner conflict continues into The Last Jedi , specifically through his conversations with Rey , with whom he connects through the Force . Rey believes that his conflict will ultimately bring him back to the light side . Ren captures her and brings her before Snoke , who orders Ren to kill her . However , Ren uses the Force to ignite a lightsaber at Snoke 's side and cut him in half , killing him . Ren beseeches Rey to join him in creating a new order , separate from the legacies created by Snoke and Luke . When Rey refuses , Ren declares himself Supreme Leader of the First Order , and orders his forces to attack the Resistance base on Crait .","entities":["Kylo Ren","First Order","Force","Rey","Snoke","General Hux","The Last Jedi","light side","Resistance base","Crait","Luke","Resistance"],"facts":["Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Luke Skywalker","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Anakin Skywalker","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Padmé Amidala","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Bail Organa","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Leia Organa"]}
