Ren engages Luke in battle and appears to blow him up and cut him in half , but Luke remains standing ; `` Luke '' is revealed to be simply a vision projected from the real Luke on Ahch - To , serving as a distraction which allows the Resistance to escape from the First Order . When Luke vanishes , the First Order storms the base , but Resistance has already evacuated ; he shares a final look with Rey through the Force before Rey closes the door to the Millennium Falcon and escapes with the Resistance . Related works and promotional material ( edit ) He is a playable character in the 2015 Force Awakens add - on to the Disney Infinity 3.0 video game , with an Infinity character figurine available separately . He is also a character in the strategy video game Star Wars : Force Arena . Hasbro has released a 3 ⁄ - inch ( 9.5 cm ) Kylo Ren action figure , and a 6 - inch ( 15 cm ) figure in their Black Series line .","entities":["Kylo Ren","First Order","Disney Infinity 3.0","Millennium Falcon","Rey","Luke","Ahch-To","Resistance","Force Awakens add-on","Hasbro","Kylo Ren 3¾-inch action figure","Kylo Ren 6-inch figure","Black Series","Star Wars: Force Arena"],"facts":["Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Luke Skywalker","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Anakin Skywalker","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Padmé Amidala","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Bail Organa","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Leia Organa"]}

